Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.42,0:01:32.19,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.21,0:01:33.94,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.96,0:01:35.77,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.80,0:01:37.63,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.26,0:01:52.12,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}なりたい自分を がむしゃらに追いかけて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.15,0:01:57.86,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}気がつけば大人になっていた
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:02.92,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}人は誰も思い通り 努力すれば夢叶うって
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:04.76,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}そんな甘くはないストーリー
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.78,0:02:06.84,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}必死こいて上目指しても
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:08.97,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}結果こそ全て 分かってる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:10.10,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}解かってない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.12,0:02:11.85,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}いつかきっと誰か見てる信じ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.87,0:02:14.14,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}今日も歩き続ける
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.17,0:02:16.94,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}諦めそう挫けそう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.96,0:02:19.17,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}から見える景色
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.13,0:02:26.72,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}絶望と苦しみの暗闇のその先
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.60,0:02:32.08,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}果てなき道の先で待つモノ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.10,0:02:35.83,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}遠くてもこの手で掴み取るため
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.86,0:02:39.42,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}理想とは違う夢のカタチ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.44,0:02:41.09,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}追い続けもがきながら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.11,0:02:43.51,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}前に進むだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:45.30,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}今この手にする
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.32,0:02:47.05,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}We change the game from our own side
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.08,0:02:50.68,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}まだ見ぬ世界を自由に生きてく
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.70,0:02:52.47,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.50,0:02:54.18,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.21,0:02:56.06,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.08,0:02:58.13,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.42,0:01:32.19,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}即便与理想中的模样大相径庭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.21,0:01:33.94,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要以自己的方式追逐心中所向
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.96,0:01:35.77,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}即便与理想中的模样大相径庭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.80,0:01:37.63,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要以自己的方式追逐心中所向
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.26,0:01:52.12,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}不顾一切追寻理想的自我 蓦然回首已褪去年少青涩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.15,0:01:57.86,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}恍然发觉早已成长为大人模样
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.28,0:02:02.92,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}人们总说只要努力付出 就能让美梦成真得偿所愿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:04.76,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}可现实哪有这般天真浪漫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.78,0:02:06.84,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}哪怕拼尽全力向上攀登
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:08.97,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}最终结果才是一切 虽然明白
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:10.10,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}却又难以释怀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.12,0:02:11.85,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}坚信终有一天会被人所见证
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.87,0:02:14.14,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}今天也继续迈步向前
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.17,0:02:16.94,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在想要放弃想要认输时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.96,0:02:19.17,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}看见的风景
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.13,0:02:26.72,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}绝望与苦痛交织的黑暗尽头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.60,0:02:32.08,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在道路终点等待着的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.10,0:02:35.83,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}哪怕遥远也要亲手将其紧握
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.86,0:02:39.42,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}与理想背道而驰的梦想形态
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.44,0:02:41.09,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}继续追寻即使遍体鳞伤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.11,0:02:43.51,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要坚定前行不止
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:45.30,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}此刻紧握在手中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.32,0:02:47.05,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}我们要从己方彻底改写规则
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.08,0:02:50.68,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在尚未知晓的世界自由生存
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.70,0:02:52.47,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}即便与理想中的模样大相径庭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.50,0:02:54.18,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要以自己的方式追逐心中所向
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.21,0:02:56.06,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}即便与理想中的模样大相径庭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.08,0:02:58.13,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要以自己的方式追逐心中所向
